WEBVTT

00:00:59.286 --> 00:01:01.088
And her most famous student,

00:01:01.112 --> 00:01:02.406
Rosa Parks.

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:05.039
She said Septima Clark
was the one who taught her

00:01:05.063 --> 00:01:07.007
the peaceful act of resistance.

00:01:07.031 --> 00:01:08.258
And when she sat down,

00:01:08.282 --> 00:01:10.880
she inspired a nation to stand.

00:01:12.174 --> 00:01:14.662
These were just three
of her 10,000 students.

00:01:14.686 --> 00:01:17.603
These women stood
on the front lines of change,

00:01:17.627 --> 00:01:19.110
and by doing so,

00:01:19.134 --> 00:01:22.481
they taught people to read
in her Citizenship School model

00:01:22.505 --> 00:01:26.690
and empowered 700,000 new voters.

00:01:26.714 --> 00:01:27.869
And that's not it.

00:01:27.893 --> 00:01:31.091
She created a new culture
of social activism.